#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.quantile.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.quantile"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.quantile:1 of
msgid "Compute the q-th quantile of each group."
msgstr "计算每个组的第 q 分位数。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.quantile.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.quantile:3 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Quantile(s) to compute, in the range ``[0, 1]``.  A scalar keeps original"
" column names; a list produces wide columns ``{col}_q{pct}``."
msgstr ""
"要计算的分位数，取值范围为 ``[0, 1]``。标量保持原始列名；列表会生成名为 `"
"`{col}_q{pct}`` 的宽列。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.quantile:7 of
msgid "Interpolation method when the quantile lies between two data points."
msgstr "当分位数位于两个数据点之间时的插值方法。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.quantile:10 of
msgid "If ``True``, silently exclude non-numeric columns."
msgstr "如果为 ``True``，静默排除非数值列。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.quantile:12 of
msgid ""
"If ``True``, use an approximate grid-summary sketch on the distributed "
"path.  See :func:`LiteFrame.quantile` for semantics."
msgstr ""
"如果为 ``True``，在分布式路径上使用近似的网格摘要草图。语义请参见 :func:`"
"LiteFrame.quantile`。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.quantile:15 of
msgid "Execution strategy for multi-chunk aggregation."
msgstr "多分块聚合的执行策略。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.quantile:17 of
msgid "Additional keyword arguments forwarded to :meth:`agg`."
msgstr "转发给 :meth:`agg` 的附加关键字参数。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.quantile.rst
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.quantile:19 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"One row per group with quantile values.  Scalar ``q`` keeps original "
"column names; a list of ``q`` produces wide columns ``{col}_q{pct}``."
msgstr ""
"每组一行，包含分位数值。标量 ``q`` 保持原始列名；``q`` 的列表会生成名为 `"
"`{col}_q{pct}`` 的宽列。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.quantile.rst
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

